lines:
辛苦了！
这里是宝可梦中心。{be01}
在这里可以
回复宝可梦的体力。{be01}
要让您的宝可梦休息一下吗？

Your Pokémon may be infected with
Pokérus.{be01}
Little is known about the Pokérus
except that they are microscopic life-{be00}
forms that attach to Pokémon.{be01}
While infected, Pokémon are said to
grow exceptionally well.

Wallace, this town’s Gym Leader, is a
powerful Trainer.{be01}
He’s rumored to be the best in the
whole Hoenn region.{be01}
But the Elite Four...{be01}
They’re said to be even stronger than
Wallace. How strong could they be?

无论何时，无论何地，
无论发生什么，{be00}
我都会和宝可梦在一起。{be01}
和宝可梦交朋友是我的乐趣！
